 R←Test_SendEmail_52(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕IO;⎕ML;⎕TRAP;parms;rc;msg;log;text
⍝ A server that offers neither AUTH LOGIN nor AUTH PLAIN: `Send` returns an error instead of crashing
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 ∆SERVER.AuthMethods←'CRAM-MD5 XOAUTH2'
 parms←∆NewMail'Created by SMTP''s ',⊃⎕SI
 (rc msg log text)←∆Send parms
 ∆SERVER.Defaults
 →T.PassesIf ¯1=rc
 →T.PassesIf'The server offers neither AUTH LOGIN nor AUTH PLAIN, only: CRAM-MD5 XOAUTH2'≡msg
 →T.PassesIf 0=≢∆SERVER.Messages

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
